# ===== Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest (22 steps, 4 chapters) =============================================
info title=Hollow Mountain
info author=Custom Islands
info description=One great snowy mountain the Delvers hollowed out over three hundred years: a sealed gate, halls on three levels joined by lifts, a sunken lake hall in its roots and a throne on an islet in the lake. Open the gate, mend the lifts, dive for the throne key - and face the king's stone guardian.
island on.arrive=message||One mountain, alone in the sea, white to its top. In its south face at the foot, a gate of iron as tall as a house - and high up on the east face, a balcony cut into the rock.

story keystone|Keystone|quest:Utopia_KeyEntrance|A wedge of blue stone carved with a Delver rune.
story crank|Lift crank|quest:Varuna_CraneKey|An iron crank for the Delvers' lifts.
story cog|Lift cog|quest:Tangaroa_GeneratorPart|A bronze cog wheel the size of a plate.
story thronekey|Throne key|quest:Temperance_SeleneGateKey|A key of black iron with a crown for a bow.
story crown|King Orm's crown|Hat_Mayor|A plain gold circlet, heavier than it looks - the last Delver king's crown, laid down.

note rune The gate rune | (carved over the great gate)\n\nTHE MOUNTAIN IS SHUT.\nThree stones shut it: one on the ice, one behind the falling water that does not fall, one with the herder.\nSet the three in their sockets and the mountain will open for you, as it opened for us.
note herderchest Herder's chest | The goat-herder's chest: a cheese wrapped in cloth, a wool blanket - and a wedge of blue stone he kept as a doorstop.
loot herderchest story:keystone*1;Wool*2;Cooked_GenericMeat*1
prop herderchest loot.refill=0
note ledger The steward's ledger | THE STEWARD'S LEDGER - THE LAST NIGHT\n\nThe king will not leave. The rest of us go.\nThe lifts' cranks: one in the workshop by this hall. The cogs: in the granary bin (the rats will have it, they have everything).\nThe throne key: down in the treasury past the sunken gate. Orm says whoever wants it must swim for it.\nThe lake hall is reached by the third lift only.
note workshopchest Workshop chest | The lower workshop's chest: chisels, a lamp - and an iron lift crank.
loot workshopchest story:crank*1;Rope*2;Nail*6
prop workshopchest loot.refill=0
note granarybin Granary bin | The granary bin, gnawed through: old grain, and under it a bronze lift cog.
loot granarybin story:cog*1;Seed_Grass*2
prop granarybin loot.refill=0
note decree The king's decree | BY ORM, KING UNDER THE MOUNTAIN\n\nI stay. My guardian stays with me. Whoever comes after: you may have the hoard, if you can sit where I sat - but my guardian will want a word.\n\nThe throne key is in the drowned treasury. Breathe at the bells.
note slate The ferryman's slate | (chalked on a slate by the lake's shore)\n\nSunken gate: straight out from here, nine fathoms of rope. Two bells on the way - air under each.\nThe islet: west, past the gate. Mind the step, it's slippery.
note drowned The drowned treasury | The drowned treasury's chest: gold gone green, a crown's worth of gems - and a key of black iron with a crown for a bow.
loot drowned story:thronekey*1;TradeToken*4;CopperIngot*2
prop drowned loot.refill=0
note orm King Orm's last words | (on a plaque on the throne)\n\nHERE SAT ORM, LAST KING UNDER THE MOUNTAIN.\nWhoever lays his crown down on the stone may take what is behind the throne.\nMy guardian kept me company. Be kind to him if he lets you.
note hoard The Delvers' hoard | The Delvers' hoard: titanium in bars, the plans for the ropeways that once ran from the mountain's top to the sea, a king's ransom in coin, and a lamp that never goes out.
loot hoard TitaniumIngot*5;Blueprint_ZiplineTool*1;TradeToken*15;HeadLight*1;MetalIngot*4
prop hoard loot.refill=0
note niche Gate niche box | A box in a niche by the gate: offerings left by travellers who couldn't get in.
loot niche Rope*2;Stone*3;Cooked_GenericMeat*1
prop niche loot.refill=0
note highbox High hall box | A box in the high hall: a spyglass case, rope, candles.
loot highbox Rope*3;Glass*2;Plastic*1
prop highbox loot.refill=0
note jettybarrel Jetty barrel | A barrel on the jetty: planks and nails.
loot jettybarrel Plank*6;Nail*8
prop jettybarrel loot.refill=0
note sunksledge Sunk sledge | A sledge that went through the ice off the beach: ore and scrap.
loot sunksledge MetalOre*3;Scrap*3;CopperOre*1
prop sunksledge loot.refill=0

prop keystone1 obj.name=keystone1
prop keystone1 beh.use=Take the keystone
prop keystone1 if.use=!signal|ks1
prop keystone1 on.use=message||A wedge of blue stone, heavier than it looks.\nhide|keystone1\ngive||story:keystone*1\nsignal||ks1\nsound||event:/exploring/utopia/metal_pickup
prop keystone2 obj.name=keystone2
prop keystone2 beh.use=Take the keystone
prop keystone2 if.use=!signal|ks2
prop keystone2 on.use=message||Behind the frozen fall, in the dark: the second keystone.\nhide|keystone2\ngive||story:keystone*1\nsignal||ks2\nsound||event:/exploring/utopia/metal_pickup
prop socket1 obj.name=socket1
prop socket1 beh.use=Set a keystone in the socket
prop socket1 if.use=quest|4\ntake|story:keystone|1\n!signal|s1
prop socket1 on.use=message||The keystone sinks into its socket with a click.\nshow|key1set\nsignal||s1\nsound||event:/exploring/temperence/selene/gate_keys
prop socket1 else.use=message||A socket shaped for a wedge of stone.
prop socket2 obj.name=socket2
prop socket2 beh.use=Set a keystone in the socket
prop socket2 if.use=quest|4\ntake|story:keystone|1\n!signal|s2\nsignal|s1
prop socket2 on.use=message||The second keystone clicks home.\nshow|key2set\nsignal||s2\nsound||event:/exploring/temperence/selene/gate_keys
prop socket2 else.use=message||A socket shaped for a wedge of stone. (The first socket first.)
prop socket3 obj.name=socket3
prop socket3 beh.use=Set a keystone in the socket
prop socket3 if.use=quest|4\ntake|story:keystone|1\n!signal|s3\nsignal|s2
prop socket3 on.use=message||The third keystone - and the mountain answers. The great gate shudders and sinks into the rock.\nshow|key3set\nsignal||s3\nopen|greatgate\nsound||event:/exploring/temperence/selene/gate_open
prop socket3 else.use=message||A socket shaped for a wedge of stone. (The first two sockets first.)
prop key1set obj.name=key1set
prop key1set beh.hidden=1
prop key2set obj.name=key2set
prop key2set beh.hidden=1
prop key3set obj.name=key3set
prop key3set beh.hidden=1
prop greatgate obj.name=greatgate
prop greatgate beh.move=0,-8,0
prop greatgate beh.moveTime=6
prop greatgate beh.moveMode=switch
prop lift1 obj.name=lift1
prop lift1 beh.use=Fit the crank and ride the lift up
prop lift1 if.use=has|story:crank|1
prop lift1 on.use=message||The crank fits. You wind, the counterweight drops, and the cage rises up the dark shaft -\nsound||event:/exploring/utopia/lift_loop\nwait|6\nteleport|midhall\nmessage||- into the mid hall.
prop lift1 else.use=message||A lift cage in a shaft. Its winding square is empty - it needs a crank.
prop lift2 obj.name=lift2
prop lift2 beh.use=Fit the cog and ride the lift up
prop lift2 if.use=has|story:cog|1\nhas|story:crank|1
prop lift2 on.use=message||The cog meshes, the crank turns, and up you go again, a long way -\nsound||event:/exploring/utopia/lift_loop\nwait|7\nteleport|highhall\nmessage||- to the high hall. Wind whistles through a window in the rock.
prop lift2 else.use=message||The second lift's gear is missing a cog. The granary, the ledger said.
prop lift3 obj.name=lift3
prop lift3 beh.use=Ride the long lift down to the lake hall
prop lift3 if.use=quest|12
prop lift3 on.use=message||Down, and down, and down - past the gate's level, past the sea's level, into the cold -\nsound||event:/exploring/utopia/lift_loop\nwait|9\nteleport|lakeshore\nmessage||- a ledge on the shore of a black lake under the mountain.
prop lift3 else.use=message||The long lift, all the way down. Read the king's decree first.
prop thronelock obj.name=thronelock
prop thronelock beh.use=Unlock the throne hall
prop thronelock if.use=has|story:thronekey|1\n!signal|throneopen
prop thronelock on.use=message||The black key turns. The doors of the throne hall slide apart - and something huge stands up beside the throne.\nsignal||throneopen\nopen|thronedoor\nshow|guardianmusic\nsound||event:/exploring/temperence/selene/gate_open
prop thronelock else.use=message||A lock shaped like a crown. The throne key is in the drowned treasury.
prop thronedoorL obj.name=thronedoor
prop thronedoorL beh.move=0,0,1.3
prop thronedoorL beh.moveTime=2
prop thronedoorL beh.moveMode=switch
prop thronedoorR obj.name=thronedoor
prop thronedoorR beh.move=0,0,-1.3
prop thronedoorR beh.moveTime=2
prop thronedoorR beh.moveMode=switch
prop guardian creature.count=1
prop guardian creature.size=2.2
prop guardian creature.health=4
prop guardian creature.damage=2.5
prop guardian creature.respawn=0
prop guardian creature.zone=thronehall
prop guardian tint.color=#6a6a6a
prop guardian tint.amount=0.6
prop guardian on.defeat=hide|guardianmusic\nmessage||The stone guardian kneels, slowly, and is still - a statue again, beside its king's empty throne.
prop guardianmusic obj.name=guardianmusic
prop guardianmusic beh.hidden=1
prop guardianmusic sound.event=event:/music/music_boss
prop guardianmusic sound.volume=0.6
prop guardianmusic zone.radius=30
prop throne obj.name=throne
prop throne beh.use=Lay King Orm's crown down on the stone
prop throne if.use=quest|20\n!signal|crownlaid
prop throne on.use=message||You lift the crown off the throne and lay it on the stone at its foot - and as you let go, you understand it is yours to carry now. Behind the throne, the grate sinks into the floor.\nsignal||crownlaid\ngive||story:crown*1\nopen|hoardgrate\nsound||event:/exploring/temperence/selene/gate_keys
prop throne else.use=message||King Orm's throne, his crown on its seat. Read the plaque.
prop hoardgrate obj.name=hoardgrate
prop hoardgrate beh.move=0,-3.2,0
prop hoardgrate beh.moveTime=3
prop hoardgrate beh.moveMode=switch

prop gatehall zone.id=gatehall
prop gatehall zone.radius=10
prop gatehall zone.repeat=never
prop gatehall zone.message=The Delvers' gate: iron, as tall as a house, a rune carved over it, three empty sockets - and two white bears asleep in the forecourt's drifts. Were asleep.
prop gatebears creature.count=2
prop gatebears creature.respawn=0
prop gatebears creature.zone=gatehall
prop entryhall zone.id=entryhall
prop entryhall zone.radius=6
prop entryhall zone.message=The entry hall: stone benches, a desk with a ledger, a lift cage in the corner - and the cold breath of the mountain's inside.
prop midhall obj.name=midhall
prop midhall zone.id=midhall
prop midhall zone.radius=6
prop midhall zone.message=The mid hall: a balcony cut through the mountain's face, the sea far below.
prop granary zone.id=granary
prop granary zone.radius=6
prop granary zone.repeat=never
prop granary zone.message=The granary - and it squeaks. Rats, everywhere, fat on three hundred years of grain!
prop rats creature.count=4
prop rats creature.respawn=0
prop rats creature.zone=granary
prop highhall obj.name=highhall
prop highhall zone.id=highhall
prop highhall zone.radius=6
prop highhall zone.message=The high hall, near the top of the world: a long window in the rock, the king's decree on the wall.
prop lakeshore obj.name=lakeshore
prop lakeshore zone.id=lakeshore
prop lakeshore zone.radius=5
prop lakeshore zone.message=The lake hall: black water under a roof of stone, columns standing in it, and far out to the west, lights on an islet.
prop sunkgate zone.id=sunkgate
prop sunkgate zone.radius=5
prop sunkgate zone.message=The sunken gate: a stone arch on the lake floor, and beyond it a room with a chest.
