quest title=The Delvers' Hoard
quest intro=A mountain the Delvers hollowed out and sealed behind them. The rune over the great gate says how to open it.
# Chapter 1 - the gate
step reach|gatehall|1|Walk up to the great gate in the south face
step read|The gate rune|1|Read the rune carved over the gate
step kill|Polar bear|2|Drive off the bears sleeping in the forecourt
step collect|story:keystone|3|Bring the three keystones: from the ice ledge, behind the frozen falls, from the herder
step reach|entryhall|1|Set the three keystones in their sockets and enter the mountain
step read|The steward's ledger|1|Read the steward's ledger in the entry hall
# Chapter 2 - the lifts
step collect|story:crank|1|Take the lift crank from the lower workshop
step reach|midhall|1|Ride the first lift up to the mid hall
step kill|Rat|4|Clear the rats out of the granary
step collect|story:cog|1|Take the bronze cog from the granary bin
step reach|highhall|1|Ride the second lift up to the high hall
step read|The king's decree|1|Read King Orm's decree
# Chapter 3 - the lake
step reach|lakeshore|1|Ride the long lift down to the lake hall
step read|The ferryman's slate|1|Read the ferryman's slate on the shore
step reach|sunkgate|1|Dive to the sunken gate (breathe at the bells)
step collect|story:thronekey|1|Take the throne key from the drowned treasury
step reach|islet|1|Swim to the islet in the lake
# Chapter 4 - the throne hall
step reach|thronehall|1|Unlock the throne hall's doors and go in
step kill|Bear|1|Face King Orm's stone guardian
step read|King Orm's last words|1|Read the plaque on the throne
step collect|story:crown|1|Lay King Orm's crown down on the stone - the grate behind the throne sinks
step open|The Delvers' hoard|1|Open the Delvers' hoard
quest done=The mountain is open, its lifts running, its king's crown laid down and his guardian at rest. The Delvers' hoard is yours - and so, if you want it, is a mountain.
quest reward=TitaniumIngot*2;MetalIngot*4;Wool*3

save Hollow Mountain
